# 📡 Smart Multi-Room Monitoring System

## 📖 Project Overview
Yeh ek IoT-based Multi-Room Monitoring System hai, jo real-time sensor data ko monitor karne ke liye design kiya gaya hai. Is project mein total **7 ESP boards** (1 Host + 6 Clients) use kiye gaye hain. Har client apne respective room ke sensors se data read karta hai aur Wi-Fi (HTTP Protocol) ke zariye Host ESP32 ko bhejta hai. Host us data ko collect karke ek responsive Web Dashboard par live display karta hai.

---

## 🛠️ Hardware Requirements

### 1. Microcontrollers
*   **ESP32 (Host & 6 Clients):** Dual-core, 240MHz, built-in Wi-Fi, 12-bit ADC. High processing power aur multiple analog pins ki wajah se yahan use kiya gaya hai.
*   **ESP8266 (NodeMCU/Lolin):** Single-core, 80/160MHz, built-in Wi-Fi, 10-bit ADC (sirf A0 pin). Sasta aur compact alternative hai.

### 2. Sensors
*   **MQ-2 Gas Sensor:** LPG, Smoke, Methane detect karta hai. Analog (AO) aur Digital (DO) output deta hai.
*   **MQ-135 Air Quality Sensor:** Air quality (CO2, NH3, Smoke) measure karta hai. Iska warm-up time 24-48 hours hota hai.
*   **HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Sensor:** Distance measure karta hai (2cm - 400cm). Trigger pulse bhej kar Echo se time measure karta hai (`Distance = Time / 58`).
*   **DHT11 Sensor:** Temperature (0-50°C) aur Humidity (20-90%) measure karta hai.
*   **IR Motion Sensor:** Motion detect karta hai. Output LOW (0) hota hai jab motion ho.
*   **Flame Sensor:** Aag (Fire) detect karta hai. Flame hone par output LOW (0) hota hai.
*   **SG90 Servo Motor:** 0° se 180° tak rotate karta hai. PWM signal se control hota hai.

