## 🔌 Pin Configuration

| Device | Room | Sensors Connected | ESP Pin Mapping |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Host** | Central | None (Web Server) | - |
| **Client 1** | Room 1 | MQ-2, Ultrasonic | MQ2 AO: GPIO34, TRIG: GPIO18, ECHO: GPIO19 |
| **Client 2** | Room 2 | MQ-2, Flame | MQ2 AO: GPIO34, Flame DO: GPIO5 |
| **Client 3** | Room 3 | MQ-135, IR | MQ135 AO: GPIO34, IR OUT: GPIO5 |
| **Client 4** | Room 4 | MQ-135, DHT11 | MQ135 AO: GPIO34, DHT DATA: GPIO18 |
| **Client 5** | Room 5 | Flame, Servo | Flame DO: GPIO5, Servo Signal: GPIO4 |
| **Client 6** | Room 6 | Flame, Servo | Flame DO: GPIO4, Servo Signal: GPIO5 |
| **ESP8266** | Client 7 | MQ-135, IR | MQ135 AO: A0, IR OUT: D5 |

